# GS22 v2: the content fetch list (2026-10-23). Every row is CC0 and was
# scouted against the live source on 2026-10-23: each row carries the real
# file URL and the md5 of the bytes that URL serves (v1 pinned the files-API
# JSON, so nothing was actually downloaded).
#
# Format: <source> <id> <url> [md5] [license] [author]
# (tools/fetch-content.mjs). The author field is one token; the real
# attributions are in the comments.
#
