# --- travertine, 1k (ambientCG, CC0) ---
# Poly Haven has no travertine asset (checked: no name matches trav* on
# 2026-10-23). ambientCG Travertine004 1K-JPG.zip (3.49 MB) holds the whole
# 1k JPG set; ambientCG's files API serves no licence or md5 field, so the
# row carries the md5 of the zip bytes scouted on 2026-10-23 and the CC0
# licence is stated on the asset page: "All assets are released under the
# Creative Commons CC0 license" (ambientcg.com/view?id=Travertine004).
